@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF7DB
skinparam noteBorderColor #D4B45D
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title 学习事实、证据和当前状态的区别
left to right direction
hide methods
class "Content Segment" as Segment <<Content>> {
  片段 identity
  source revision
}
class "Annotation Result" as Annotation <<Enrichment>> {
  语境提示
  result revision
}
class "Learning Event" as Event <<Learning>> {
  行为事实
  canonical order
}
class "Learning Evidence" as Evidence <<Learning>> {
  事件来源
  reducer version
}
class "Profile Snapshot" as Profile <<Vocabulary>> {
  已应用状态
  projection version
}
class "Delivery Status" as Delivery <<Delivery>> {
  投递观察
  订阅状态
}
Annotation -left-> Segment : 绑定来源
Delivery -left-> Annotation : 跟踪同一结果
Event -up-> Annotation : 显示或点击因果引用
Event -right-> Evidence : 版本化归约
Evidence -right-> Profile : 幂等应用
note bottom of Profile
  accepted intent revision 属于 Learning
  projection version 属于 Vocabulary
end note
legend bottom
  概念关系图；不是 SQL、Java 类型或字段设计
endlegend
@enduml
